    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38931" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί-βλημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is thrown over, covering</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicostr.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>; <i>coverlet, bedspread,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(5).593.4
			</span></i> (Iulis, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.638
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.85
			</span></i>; <i>head-covering</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				11.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>tapestry, hangings</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Ma.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
