				<u>An.</u>
				6.29.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>that
				which is put on</i>, <i>piece of embroidery</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποικίλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.387.28
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				22.1514.31
			</span></i>; <i>mantle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				3.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>patch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Matt.
				9.16
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>.
				<i>outer bandage</i>, Paul. Aeg.<i><span class="en">
				6.92
			</span></i>.</div>
